The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls — game rules, card names, texts and art
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls is designed by Edmund McMillen and
published by Maestro Media (first edition: Studio71).
Card names, card texts, card artwork and rules belong to their owners.
Card artwork is credited to its artists inside the app, per card.

Card images are not in this repository. They live in the private
repository FourSoulsRepo/card_db (git submodule pkg/card_db/images) and
ship inside release binaries built with -tags cardimages.

The game's fonts live there too (assets/fonts) and ship the same way:
  font-souls Title and Body, fan replicas of the card fonts (Latin).
    Copyright (c) 2020 Matheus Assis. MIT.
    https://github.com/AssisrMatheus/font-souls
