The home screen banner lives there too (assets/banner.webp):
  The Four Souls logo from the top of https://foursouls.ru. It belongs
    to Edmund McMillen and Maestro Media.

The menu background lives there too (assets/background):
  The starry page background of https://foursouls.ru: its sky and five
